[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3302.27, "timestamp": "00:55:02", "text": "故事。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3304.109, "timestamp": "00:55:04", "text": "上帝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3307.91, "timestamp": "00:55:07", "text": "嗯，是的，它坏了，我只能……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3311.19, "timestamp": "00:55:11", "text": "用它在直播电脑上进行一次直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3315.87, "timestamp": "00:55:15", "text": "自从我把它放上去之后，我就没再放过它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3318.109, "timestamp": "00:55:18", "text": "意识到这一天将会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3322.39, "timestamp": "00:55:22", "text": "时间一晃而过，五年多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3325.589, "timestamp": "00:55:25", "text": "本来这将是第六年了，呃，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3329.99, "timestamp": "00:55:29", "text": "如果属实，那将在今年（2025年）5月举行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3333.67, "timestamp": "00:55:33", "text": "如果它存活到五月，就变成五月。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3335.63, "timestamp": "00:55:35", "text": "应该是六个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3338.309, "timestamp": "00:55:38", "text": "多年来，我一直非常珍惜这一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3339.79, "timestamp": "00:55:39", "text": "保留了这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3353.069, "timestamp": "00:55:53", "text": "恐鸟但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3359.39, "timestamp": "00:55:59", "text": "令人遗憾的是，全科医生约翰"}]